{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"storehouse","model_identifier":"storehouse","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# storehouse\n\nStorehouse: a plain, sturdy barn with wide double doors, barrels and sacks stacked out front.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a warehouse of cream plaster and brown half-timbering under a golden thatch roof, with teal doors and shutters. A hoist dormer over the double doors carries a beam, pulley and hanging crate; a ridge cupola, nine lit windows, lanterns, and goods piled all round (crates, barrels, sacks, a loaded handcart, hay, firewood, a ladder).\n\n- Footprint: 9 x 7 columns (144 x 112 units, 4.05 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -73..73, y 0..142, z -54..56 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 704, construction_0 62, construction_33 376, construction_66 474, ruined 341 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `storehouse_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 128 x 132 x 80 centred at x 0, z 8\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `fx_window_1` at (43.5, 36, -32)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-43.5, 36, -32)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-38, 36, 44)\n- `fx_window_4` at (38, 36, 44)\n- `fx_window_5` at (62, 36, -12)\n- `fx_window_6` at (62, 86.5, 6)\n- `fx_window_7` at (-62, 36, -12)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-62, 86.5, 6)"},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"stone_plinth#8d857a","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-63,0,-33],"to":[63,8,45],"autouv":0,"color":3,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[452,298,578,306],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[704,298,782,306],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[578,298,704,306],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[782,298,860,306],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[268,0,394,78],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8ba19b78-2de8-c942-e834-6a6eafd9431d"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_cap#7c756b","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-63.5,6.8,-33.5],"to":[63.5,7.9,45.5],"autouv":0,"color":1,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[730,387,857,388],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[298,389,377,390],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[857,387,984,388],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[377,389,456,390],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[14,0,141,79],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[141,0,268,79],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"22d9d419-5149-b35f-885e-a0bb089e3196"},{"name":"stone_step_1#9a9288","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-30,0.26,-38.5],"to":[30,3.8,-32.5],"autouv":0,"color":5,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[190,345,250,349],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[126,353,132,357],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null},"west":{"uv":[132,353,138,357],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[941,322,1001,328],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,329,60,335],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8ebc0d20-0c6c-46f5-8a71-648fe660a8ca"},{"name":"stone_step_2#a39b90","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allo