099a6092a393","bdd39052-d2c0-f3d0-a1d8-5e525cbbf317","29165337-b2d9-28f0-0762-1b7bb87a6cc4","3f661fdf-3dbb-e2fb-a06e-c9124bb71f32","dc78a39f-d14f-e3ab-1a3b-fdc8125841ce","57720498-8e70-e122-7c39-cc18d06243d5","b339f42c-e610-9536-ac29-1efab30fc921","d6d5189b-c3bf-e142-095b-5aef818b97e1","c266278f-402e-6f2b-9468-9c47afe74aba","a7a15bc9-f2a5-fd33-e1f1-982d444c5198","610bc00f-f000-df58-e804-76218a716818","6dcbc977-45b6-fa52-da18-e14f6558d0b6","7fd031c2-4f2e-e806-bd68-620fff5b1b03"],"reset":false,"shade":true,"mirror_uv":false,"autouv":0,"isOpen":false,"primary_selected":false}],"reset":false,"shade":true,"mirror_uv":false,"autouv":0,"isOpen":false,"primary_selected":false}],"textures":[{"name":"storehouse.png","path":"","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","group":"","scope":0,"width":1024,"height":512,"uv_width":1024,"uv_height":512,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","file_format":"png","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","wrap_mode":"limited","pbr_channel":"color","fps":7,"frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"58418896-a34e-5bdc-bf86-74b0598e4e60","source":"data:image/png;base64,","relative_path":""}],"description":"# storehouse\n\nStorehouse: a plain, sturdy barn with wide double doors, barrels and sacks stacked out front.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a warehouse of cream plaster and brown half-timbering under a golden thatch roof, with teal doors and shutters. A hoist dormer over the double doors carries a beam, pulley and hanging crate; a ridge cupola, nine lit windows, lanterns, and goods piled all round (crates, barrels, sacks, a loaded handcart, hay, firewood, a ladder).\n\n- Footprint: 9 x 7 columns (144 x 112 units, 4.05 x 3.15 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -73..73, y 0..142, z -54..56 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 704, construction_0 62, construction_33 376, construction_66 474, ruined 341 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `storehouse_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 128 x 132 x 80 centred at x 0, z 8\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `fx_window_1` at (43.5, 36, -32)\n- `fx_window_2` at (-43.5, 36, -32)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-38, 36, 44)\n- `fx_window_4` at (38, 36, 44)\n- `fx_window_5` at (62, 36, -12)\n- `fx_window_6` at (62, 86.5, 6)\n- `fx_window_7` at (-62, 36, -12)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-62, 86.5, 6)"}